{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isProvisional","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A provisional event is identified based on real-time detections, but may change in the near"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"future as more data is collected and processed, to filter out unwanted artifacts. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, a provisional car transport may get identified, followed by a provisional bus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transport. After the full trip is complete, these provisional events may get merged into"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a single final car event."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Final events are generated independently of the provisional events, and have unique"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event IDs. They are not linked to the provisional events they may resemble, replace,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or overlap with."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Currently, provisional events apply to transport types and to off-the-grid events whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reasons are compatible with flight detection. A provisional off-the-grid event keeps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current processing window open because it may later be replaced by a flight."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Until that window concludes, clients that exclude provisional events will not receive a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"final off-the-grid event, and the preceding stationary event will remain ongoing."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/senttimelineevent\/isprovisional"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/senttimelineevent\/isprovisional"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK","doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTTimelineEvent"]]},"metadata":{"title":"isProvisional","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isProvisional","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SENTTimelineEvent(py)isProvisional","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"isProvisional","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"SENTSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTTimelineEvent\/isProvisional","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Indicates whether the event is provisional."}],"references":{"doc://com.sentiance.SENTSDK/documentation/SENTSDK/SENTTimelineEvent":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTTimelineEvent","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SENTTimelineEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"SENTTimelineEvent","url":"\/documentation\/sentsdk\/senttimelineevent","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Represents an occurrence of an event that was detected for a user.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SENTTimelineEvent"